----------------------------------------------------------------------
External binaries (NOT bundled — installed separately by the user)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

  FFmpeg
    https://ffmpeg.org/
    LGPL or GPL depending on the build. RIN never bundles the FFmpeg
    binary; the installer script suggests `winget install Gyan.FFmpeg`
    and RIN invokes it only as a subprocess. No FFmpeg headers or
    libraries are linked into RIN.

  GitHub Copilot CLI
    https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/copilot-cli
    Proprietary, owned by GitHub. RIN only invokes it as a subprocess
    when the user explicitly selects "copilot_cli" as the LLM provider.
    The user must be signed in via `copilot login`.

  Pre-downloaded ML model weights
    sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2  — Apache-2.0
    Whisper (OpenAI, faster-whisper conversion) — MIT
    RapidOCR ONNX models                     — Apache-2.0
    All weights are downloaded by `scripts/prefetch_models.py` or on
    first use from Hugging Face / model authors' CDNs.

